       <li><strong data-stat="launchpad">&mdash;</strong><span>from the Ubuntu PPA (Noble and Resolute)</span></li>
-      <li><strong data-stat="copr">&mdash;</strong><span>Fedora repository enablements (COPR)</span></li>
