     </ul>
     <p class="stats-note" id="diffusion-arch">Arch Linux (AUR) has no counter: the AUR only distributes a build recipe, and the package is compiled on the user's machine from the GitHub source archive, which GitHub does not count.</p>
     <p class="stats-note">As of <time data-stat-date></time></p>
